.TH BEAM 1 beam\-VERSION
.SH NAME
beam \- ephemeral local-first file and video sharing utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B beam
.RB [ \-1cpqrv ]
.RB [ \-t
.IR ttl ]
.RB [ \-b
.IR ip ]
.RB [ \-P
.IR port ]
.RI file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B beam
is a suckless, dependency-free command-line tool that generates a short-lived,
secure link to share videos and files directly from your machine.
.P
When sharing videos,
.B beam
automatically detects media types and serves an embedded, responsive HTML5
video player for immediate playback on mobile devices (iOS Safari, Android
Chrome) or desktop browsers. Full HTTP 206 Partial Content (Range requests)
is supported for seamless video seeking and scrubbing without requiring
multi-gigabyte downloads.
.P
.B beam
generates a 128-bit unguessable random token in the URL path, prints an
ANSI QR code in the terminal for instant camera scanning, and terminates
automatically after a configurable lifetime (default 5 hours).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-t " ttl"
Set link lifetime. Suffixes
.BR s " (seconds),"
.BR m " (minutes),"
.BR h " (hours),"
or
.BR d " (days)"
are supported. Default is
.BR 5h .
.TP
.B \-p
Spawn an ephemeral public HTTPS reverse tunnel via SSH (localhost.run) so
the link can be accessed over the internet outside your local network.
.TP
.B \-c
Copy the generated share URL to the system clipboard (integrates with
.BR clipbridge ,
.BR wl-copy ,
.BR xclip ,
.BR pbcopy ,
or
.BR clip.exe ).
.TP
.B \-q
Quiet mode. Suppress the terminal QR code and display only textual details.
.TP
.B \-1
One-shot mode. Exit immediately after the first complete file download or view.
.TP
.B \-r
Raw stream only. Disable the HTML5 web player and always serve the file directly.
.TP
.BI \-b " ip"
Specify the IP address to bind to. Default is
.BR 0.0.0.0 .
.TP
.BI \-P " port"
Specify the port to listen on. Default is
.BR 8080 ,
or the next available port.
.TP
.B \-v
Print version information to standard output and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Share a dubbed video with default 5-hour lifetime:
.IP
.EX
beam dubbed_video.mp4
.EE
.P
Share a video over the internet with public HTTPS tunnel and copy link:
.IP
.EX
beam -p -c dubbed_video.mp4
.EE
.P
Share a zip archive valid for 30 minutes in one-shot mode:
.IP
.EX
beam -t 30m -1 archive.zip
.EE
.P
Share without terminal QR code on port 9000:
.IP
.EX
beam -q -P 9000 document.pdf
.EE
